<BaseLayout title="About Mercer Lane Press" description="Mercer Lane Press publishes practical nonfiction built around clear systems, troubleshooting, and useful reference material."><Breadcrumbs items={[{name:'Home',href:'/'},{name:'About'}]}/><article class="page-head wrap prose"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT THE PRESS</p><h1>Useful books for specific problems</h1><p class="lede">Mercer Lane Press publishes practical nonfiction that helps readers replace guesswork with a clear process.</p><h2>Our publishing approach</h2><p>Some problems become manageable once their parts are visible. Our guides emphasize structured troubleshooting, careful observation, and useful reference material that readers can return to while they work.</p><p>We aim to explain distinctions that matter, organize decisions in a sensible order, and help readers understand what a result means. The goal is practical progress without inflated promises.</p><h2>Explore the catalog</h2><p>Browse <a href="/books/">our books</a>, or begin with the free <a href="/guides/">practical guides</a>.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For general enquiries about Mercer Lane Press, email <a href="mailto:mercerlanepress@gmail.com">mercerlanepress@gmail.com</a> or visit the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p></article></BaseLayout>
